  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Follow-up trade mission to Benin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment aims to give follow-up on the trade mission organised to Benin from 17 to 19 October 2022. It will facilitate potential business partners to further elaborate their joint business aspirations.Participants of the trade mission &#x2013; seven Dutch companies and over 50 Beninese companies &#x2013; will be interviewed and continued exchange is facilitated.A number of Beninese companies will be visited to assess their demand and offer in matchmaking.Barriers to establish partnerships and challenges in enabling environment and ways for Dutch companies to share their expertise and knowledge to professionalise the horticulture sector in Benin will be identified and addressed.</narrative>
  </description>
